  <TITLE>
    <TI>
      <NO.DOC.C>(2004/C 88 E/0023)</NO.DOC.C>
      <P>WRITTEN QUESTION E-1311/03</P>
      <P>by Bill Newton Dunn (ELDR) to the Commission</P>
      <P>(<DATE ISO="20030407">7 April 2003</DATE>)</P>
    </TI>
  </TITLE>
  <CONTENTS>
    <GR.SEQ LEVEL="1">
      <TITLE>
        <TI>
          <NP>
            <NO.P>
              <HT TYPE="ITALIC">Subject:</HT>
            </NO.P>
            <TXT>The imprisonment of Dr Oscar Ellis Biscet by the Cuban authorities</TXT>
          </NP>
        </TI>
      </TITLE>
      <GR.SEQ LEVEL="2">
        <P>The Commission may be aware of the imprisonment of Dr Oscar Ellias Biscet, a Cuban human rights activist, by the Cuban authorities.</P>
        <P>Has the Commission:</P>
        <LIST TYPE="ARAB">
          <ITEM>
            <NP>
              <NO.P>1.</NO.P>
              <TXT>Made representations to the Cuban Government about the imprisonment of Dr Oscar Ellias Biscet?</TXT>
            </NP>
          </ITEM>
          <ITEM>
            <NP>
              <NO.P>2.</NO.P>
              <TXT>Other plans, to try to ensure that the Cuban authorities respect the human rights of their citizens?</TXT>
            </NP>
          </ITEM>
        </LIST>
      </GR.SEQ>
    </GR.SEQ>
  </CONTENTS>
